# BuildKit sends only what a Dockerfile COPYs: go.mod, go.sum, internal/, and server/ or
# client/bot/. These keep a local config (a live admin token) and stale binaries out of those
# two directories.
server/config.yaml
server/seshat
client/bot/seshat-bot
# Never COPYed today; listed so a broader COPY cannot pick up a secret or the history.
.git
config.yaml
dev
docker/secrets
